label Greeting
# [signal arg="refresh_desires"]
if {Transaction_GreetingVar} <= 50:
	Rodel: Greetings, Keeper of the Dry Shelves. I find the atmosphere here remarkably abrasive today.
else:
	Rodel: Ambassador. Your terrestrial sun is behaving like a relentless predator. My fluid-reserves are low.
	Rodel: I require a {Transaction_ItemWants} to stabilize my hydro-stasis. 
[end_timeline]

label Talk
if {Transaction_TalkVar} <= 50:
	Rodel: I require a {Transaction_ItemWants} to stabilize my hydro-stasis. 
else:
	Rodel: I must acquire a {Transaction_ItemWants}. [pause=0.4] This land-fuel is necessary for my continued search.
- Stand by, Rodel.
	Rodel: Understood. Maintaining position. Efficiency check: optimal.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, Rodel, we're fresh out of stock.
	Rodel: A critical error. My search must be re-routed. [pause=0.4] Farewell, Ambassador.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]


label Partial
Rodel: Acceptable. I still require a {Transaction_ItemWants} to complete this module.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 50:
	Rodel: Excellent. [pause=0.4] A successful exchange. My thank-currents to you, Ambassador.
else:
	Rodel: My hydro-stasis is stabilized for now. [pause=0.5] May the tides of your commerce remain high.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
if {Transaction_WrongItemVar} <= 50:
	Rodel: This is... [pause=0.5] incorrect. This item lacks the necessary properties for a {Transaction_ItemWants}.
else:
	Rodel: I believe there has been a desync in our communication. This is not the {Transaction_ItemWants} I requested.
[end_timeline]
